 * are the CUDA statements verbatim; the only changes are mechanical:
 *   - gfix_add / k_grad_fix_to_double -> pfix_add / k_pfix_to_double (same 2^52 fixed point as the CUDA GRAD_FIX,
 *     incl. the chunking above 64 and the sticky bad flag g_pfix_bad);
 *   - __shfl_down_sync / __ballot_sync (32 lanes) -> __shfl_down(v, o, 32) / __ballot (wave32: the CMake check
 *     admits only RDNA gfx10xx-gfx12xx, docs/SQM_ROCM.md).
 * Included inside the anonymous namespace of xtb_hip_context.hip (after the vacuum kernels); everything here lives
 * in the nested namespace pbc_dev, so names shared with the vacuum kernels (k_d3_weights, k_d3_cn) do not collide.
 * 🤖 AI-generated, ⚙️ machine-tested only.
